#: ../../engines.md:1 fd58f4c4d9714a03aed33155bdc85622
msgid "Choosing an engine"
msgstr "選擇引擎"

#: ../../engines.md:3 a8b46d64560342dcb00032fb2a3befc5
msgid "The engine block is part of the *request*, not part of the graph, so changing it costs a price and never a rebuild. Pick the method and the interface shows the parameter block that belongs to it — a field that does not apply cannot be set, rather than being set and dropped."
msgstr "引擎區塊屬於*請求*，不屬於物件圖，因此改動它的代價是一次計價，永遠不是一次重建。挑好方法，介面就顯示屬於它的參數區塊——不適用的欄位無法被設定，而不是設定了再被丟掉。"

#: ../../engines.md fb4f7de58aa2490fb7dda300e41b6db2
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../engines.md 2b16bc9a57d94491a69eb7a420a4c9d6
